<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>LinUCB</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The estimated parameter is:</p>
<table id="A4.E2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\theta}_{a}=A_{a}^{-1}\mathbf{b}_{a}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\theta}_{a}=A_{a}^{-1}\mathbf{b}_{a}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Given a query feature vector <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, the upper confidence bound (UCB) for arm <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> is:</p>
<table id="A4.E3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{UCB}_{a}(\mathbf{x})=\mathbf{x}^{\top}\hat{\theta}_{a}+\alpha\sqrt{\mathbf{x}^{\top}A_{a}^{-1}\mathbf{x}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mtext>UCB</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{UCB}_{a}(\mathbf{x})=\mathbf{x}^{\top}\hat{\theta}_{a}+\alpha\sqrt{\mathbf{x}^{\top}A_{a}^{-1}\mathbf{x}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(3)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> controls the exploration–exploitation trade-off. The arm selected is:</p>
<table id="A4.E4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a^{*}=\argmax_{a\in\mathcal{A}}\text{UCB}_{a}(\mathbf{x})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mtext>UCB</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a^{*}=\argmax_{a\in\mathcal{A}}\text{UCB}_{a}(\mathbf{x}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(4)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.4" class="ltx_p">Upon observing reward <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>, update:</p>
<table id="A4.E5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{a}\leftarrow A_{a}+\mathbf{x}\mathbf{x}^{\top},\quad\mathbf{b}_{a}\leftarrow\mathbf{b}_{a}+r\,\mathbf{x}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{a}\leftarrow A_{a}+\mathbf{x}\mathbf{x}^{\top},\quad\mathbf{b}_{a}\leftarrow\mathbf{b}_{a}+r\,\mathbf{x}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(5)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>LinUCB+KL Bandit Strategy</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The algorithm is initialized with parameters: number of arms <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{arms}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>arms</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{arms}}</annotation></semantics></math>, dimension <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>, regularization parameter <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>, exploration parameter <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, noise variance <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{\text{noise}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{\text{noise}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and KL-bound constant <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math>. Each arm <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> maintains a matrix <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{A}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{A}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> and a vector <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{b}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{b}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math>, initialized as <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\mathbf{I}_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\mathbf{I}_{d}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.SS2.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{0}_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mn>𝟎</mn><mi>d</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{0}_{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The <span id="A4.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">select_arm</span> method computes the score for each arm <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> using the following formulation:</p>
<table id="A4.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\theta_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\theta_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{A}_{a}^{-1}\mathbf{b}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{A}_{a}^{-1}\mathbf{b}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mu_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mu_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{x}^{\top}\theta_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{x}^{\top}\theta_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{var}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>var</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{var}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{x}^{\top}\mathbf{A}_{a}^{-1}\mathbf{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{x}^{\top}\mathbf{A}_{a}^{-1}\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle n_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle n_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\max(1,\text{counts}[a])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext>counts</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\max(1,\text{counts}[a])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{raw\_bound}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>raw_bound</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{raw\_bound}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\log(t)+c\log(\log(t+1))}{n_{a}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\log(t)+c\log(\log(t+1))}{n_{a}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{bound}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>bound</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{bound}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\max(\text{raw\_bound}_{a},0.0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mtext>raw_bound</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>0.0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\max(\text{raw\_bound}_{a},0.0)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{bonus}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>bonus</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{bonus}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sqrt{2\cdot\text{var}_{a}\cdot\text{bound}_{a}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mtext>var</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mtext>bound</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sqrt{2\cdot\text{var}_{a}\cdot\text{bound}_{a}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{score}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{score}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mu_{a}+\text{bonus}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>bonus</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mu_{a}+\text{bonus}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math> is the context vector, <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> is the time step, and <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{counts}[a]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>counts</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{counts}[a]</annotation></semantics></math> is the number of times arm <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> has been selected. The arm with the highest score is selected for exploration.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The <span id="A4.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">update</span> method updates the matrix <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{A}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{A}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> and vector <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{b}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{b}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> for the selected arm <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> based on the received reward <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A4.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
