</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">This strategy leverages the KL-bound to dynamically adjust exploration bonuses, enhancing the LinUCB algorithm’s ability to balance exploration and exploitation in a contextual setting.</p>
</div>
