</figure>
<figure id="A4.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>Detailed Summary and Examples of Feature Categories, Definitions, and Examples (See Table <a href="#A4.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ D.7 Thompson Sampling ‣ Appendix D Summary of Bandits ‣ No One Size Fits All: QueryBandits for LLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>). These definitions and examples become the prompts to create the binary context vector for our bandits.</figcaption>
<table id="A4.T11.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A4.T11.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
